# VOICEVOX_URL=http://127.0.0.1:50021
# VOICEVOX_SPEAKER_ID=14
# Default is 14 — 冥鳴ひまり (Meimei Himari), picked for a calm/mature tone matching
# Avelyn's persona. Run `npm run cli -- speakers` to see all installed voices.
# VOICEVOX_DEBUG_TIMING=1
# Off by default. Set to log each speak() call's audioQuery/synthesize/total
# timings to stderr — see README.md's Latency section.
